  .select('name age')
  .sort({ name: 1 });
```

Aggregation transforms documents through ordered stages. Learn `$match`, `$project`, `$group`, `$sort`, `$limit`, `$unwind`, and `$lookup`; put selective `$match` stages early and inspect pipeline cost.

```javascript
const totals = await Order.aggregate([
  { $match: { status: 'paid' } },
  { $group: { _id: '$userId', total: { $sum: '$amount' } } },
  { $sort: { total: -1 } }
]);
```

MongoDB is a document-oriented NoSQL database suited to flexible, nested records and evolving schemas. Choose it based on access patterns and consistency needs, not simply because the data is JSON-shaped.

