Debouncing waits until input activity pauses before firing a function, reducing repeated search requests. Cancel pending timers on cleanup and combine with request cancellation to prevent stale results.

```javascript
useEffect(() => {
  const timer = setTimeout(() => setDebouncedQuery(query), 300);
  return () => clearTimeout(timer);
}, [query]);
```

`req` contains method, path, params, query, headers, body, and authenticated context; `res` sends status, headers, and response data. Send exactly one response per request and return after sending it.

```typescript
import type { Request, Response } from 'express';

